<acceptance_gate>
Contract tests use only an injected transport and sanitized recorded fixtures under `tests/fixtures/research/`. Outbound `fetch` is stubbed to throw. Generation is never accepted if tests contact live Rtrvr or spend credits.
</acceptance_gate>

<deliverables>
Generate the implementation only, as a single module exporting `researchWithRtrvr`.
Contract tests already exist at `tests/contracts/rtrvr_research_adapter.contract.test.ts` and must not be modified by generation.
</deliverables>
